<title>UK: TABLE - Symonds yr pre-tax profit up 86 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Symonds yr pre-tax profit up 86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.6		    vs 4.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.2		    vs 1.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 1.8		    vs 1.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.69		   vs 1.45</p>
<p> Turnover		   30.96		  vs 14.23</p>
<p>NOTE - Symonds said overall profitability had been reduced by 1.5 million stg following a significant mis-statement of management accounts in the precision engineering division. New management is in place but the division is not expected to contribute to profitability this year. The company said the whole group looked set for continued growth once the division was back on track.</p>
<p>Full company name - Symonds plc, a manufacturer of printed circuit boards.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
